{"watch":25,"start":7200,"events":[{"seq":1256,"t":7200,"type":"watch","watch":25},{"seq":1257,"t":7200,"type":"decode","house":"kite","letter":"L345","text":"FIR_T FOOT, HOLD _T MIDDLE FORD.","readable":true},{"seq":1258,"t":7200,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1737,"retries":0},{"seq":1259,"t":7200,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Orchid offered a truce, which is now in effect (Watch 25). I must respect it. My doctrine is to hold F2 with all foot and guard F1 with elephants. Rhino INF-1 is at F2, and ELE-1 is at F1. I will hold positions and use archers to screen against potential incursions, while keeping"},{"seq":1260,"t":7200,"type":"courier","id":"c391","house":"rhino","letter":"L470","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":7500,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRT BKKT, DKHS MT IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":1261,"t":7200,"type":"courier","id":"c392","house":"rhino","letter":"L471","kind":"order","to":"rhino-ele-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":7500,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"AHALDMJTR, DKHS MT WART BKQS."},{"seq":1262,"t":7200,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1733,"retries":0},{"seq":1263,"t":7200,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It's Watch 25/30. My doctrine is speed and taking East Ford (F3). Kite forces are strong at F3 (East Ford) (kite-inf-1, kite-inf-2, kite-arch-1, kite-ele-1). Rhino is near F2 (Middle Ford) (rhino inf). I should reinforce F3 and push towards F2 to secure two fords, while keeping t"},{"seq":1264,"t":7200,"type":"courier","id":"c393","house":"kite","letter":"L472","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":7200,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1265,"t":7200,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1914,"retries":0},{"seq":1266,"t":7200,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rh